OL,3,AGirl seriously injured in wolf attack
OL,4,Aat German wildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl has been
OL,7,Fseriously injured in a wolf attack at a
OL,8,FGerman wildlife park.
OL,10,FShe was inside an enclosure at the
OL,11,FJohannismuhle park in Brandenburg,
OL,12,Fsouth of Berlin, with a staff member
OL,13,Fand two other children when the attack
OL,14,Fhappened, police said.
OL,16,FThey said in a statement that the
OL,17,F"precise circumstances of the incident
OL,18,Fare the subject of an ongoing police
OL,19,Finvestigation".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
